      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `b3d54735103ea11d7d0cc96cd3b0e413957eb53501b7ae971c299305a9c54db9--prisoners-australia-2025-federal-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2025\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 4dea5a45dade86fcc625cf7ab7570358c5de291152f92bcfb9bcfbce19ebef18 | missing |\n| \"Table 36\" | 392dea40918da9cc22715fb31eca29e90677fd0b243192bd617bdca161309880 | missing |\n| \"Table 37\" | 81a1fcca3fe08357c0b687b3f75bcfe066eaae1c0abc4542de21eab17b5550e9 | missing |\n| \"Table 38\" | edc6ee4ec17242d0bec5e5cd3e8a4c5c62863e1b4e15a50d54ab6b7ae88cd138 | missing |\n| \"Table 39\" | b27f2e6895a5398bf2926d4aafa2697f35522d112b4e473d67cdea4ec2b673d4 | missing |\n| \"Further information\" | 855f32a91d83d163bc8b1e6bb2f7851fbf36ba609c354858c0c6870aa19ad19e | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (c90bed80eabd8ab3134b40122e232db5514e05330a534a0bdf50dda3fcfe1348). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
